        },
        {
          "text": " Daudi n'abashaija be baahika Zikulaagi aha kiro kya kashatu, baashanga Abaamaleki baateire Negebu na Zikulaagi; baasingwire Zikulaagi, kandi baagyokize; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.76.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 76:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " baanyagire abakazi n'abaabaire bagitwiremu boona, abato n'abakuru; bataine u baitsire, kureka babatwaire, beegyendeire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi n'abashaija be ku baahikire omuri orwo rurembo, baashanga barwokize, kandi abakazi baabo na batabani baabo na bahara baabo banyagirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahonaaho Daudi n'abu yaabaire aine, baimutsya amaraka gaabo, baaborooga, okuhitsya obu baahikire ahu batakibaasiza kuborooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi abakazi ba Daudi bombi, Ahinoamu owa Yezereeli na Abigaili owaabaire ari muka Nabali owa Karumeeli, nabo bakaba banyagirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.17.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 17:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.8.59"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 8:59",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.4.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 4:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Daudi yaashaasha munonga, ahabw'okuba abantu bakaba nibagira ngu bamuteere amabaare; ahakuba abantu boona bakaba baine obushaarizi omu mutima, buri muntu naasaasibwa batabani be na bahara be; kwonka Daudi yaayehamiza omuri MUKAMA Ruhanga we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
