            "verseId": "1SA.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima baashanga Omunyamisri omu ishwa, baamureetera Daudi, baamuha omugaati, yaarya; baamuha n'amaizi g'okunywa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi baamuha omwate gumwe aha kiihuro ky'ebijuma by'emitiini n'emitsitsa ebiri y'emizaabibu eyomire. Ku yaaherize kurya, yaagarukwamu amaani; ahabw'okuba akaba amazire ebiro bishatu atarikurya n'obu kwakuba okunywa, nyomushana na nyekiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yaamubuuza ati: Ori ow'oha? Kandi nooruga hi? Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Ndi omutsigazi Omunyamisri, omuhuuku w'Omuamaleki; mukama wangye antsigireho, ahakuba ebiro bishatu ebihingwire mbaire ndwaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.14.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 14:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Tukaba tuteire Negebu ey'Abakeresi n'ey'Abayuda, n'eya Kalebu, twayotsya Zikulaagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yaamubuuza ati: Okaanyebembera, ompitsya omuri ezo ngabo? Onu ati: Ndahira Ruhanga ku otarikwija kuunyita, n'obu kwakuba okumpayo omu mikono ya mukama wangye, mbone kuzikuhitsyamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
