            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.22.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 22:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka abantu babi boona abataine buntu, omuri abo abahurwire na Daudi, baagira bati: Titurikwija kubaha aha minyago ei tugarwire, ahakuba tibahurwire naitwe, kureka buri muntu tumuhe omukazi we n'abaana be, babatware, bagyende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka Daudi yaagira ati: Beene waitu, tikwo murikwija kutwaza ebi MUKAMA atuhaire, MUKAMA oturinzire, akahayo omu mikono yaitu ezo ngabo ezibaire zituteire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
