              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 68:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nimugira ngu hariho orikwija kwikiriza ekyo eki murikugamba? Ahakuba omugabo gw'ogiire aha rugamba nikyo kimwe n'ogw'otsigaire aha bintu; boona nibaija kubagana, bainganise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwiha ahari eryo izooba yaakihindura ekiragiro n'omugyenzo omuri Israeli n'okuhitsya hati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
